OmnySSH (Chinese-optimized edition)

This distribution is based on OmnySSH by Tim Hartmann and contributors:
https://github.com/timhartmann7/omnyssh

This distribution contains modifications, including Simplified Chinese
localization, user OpenSSH configuration and key management, system-terminal
and system-tray integration, desktop host cards, and related reliability and
interface improvements.

